{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13101180","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:6:1310118001:0":{"text":"ふぅ……吹雪の中の登山に、狼に、雪崩にリーフベアー……本当にスリル満点な一日でしたね！","source_cn":"呼……在大雪天里爬山，又是狼，又是雪崩，又是叶角熊……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F4F486C8C59C68A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310118002:0":{"text":"疲れただろう。何か食べるか？体が暖まるヒノヨモギを入れて煮込む肉と野菜のスープ、それとパンでどうだね？","source_cn":"你们一定很累了，想要吃点东西吗？肉、蔬菜，加上火绒蒿—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFCBC194AA7E46AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310118003:0":{"text":"わあ、美味しそう！フェルガルドさんは薬草にお詳しいのですか？","source_cn":"太棒了，听起来好香！法拉莫尔先生，你似乎对草药很有研究？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79560120757F8761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310118004:1":{"text":"普段よく使うものについて少し詳しいだけだ。それよりも、食事の用意をしよう。先ほどからロンロン君のお腹が不満の声を上げているようだからね。","source_cn":"谈不上“很有研究”，只是对常用的草药比较熟悉而已。我还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDB1C577B82C76A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310118005:0":{"text":"うえっ……わ、笑わないでください！本当にクタクタでお腹もペコペコなんです。あ、スープは大盛りでお願いします！","source_cn":"哎呀……这个……不准笑！今天真的很累很饿！法拉莫尔先生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D8E6A7B2C61EFB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1310118006:0":{"text":"ストーブを囲んで、温かいスープを堪能した。一日の疲れもすっかり吹き飛んだようだ。","source_cn":"汤煮好了，你们围坐在火炉边吃了热乎乎的炖汤，感觉一整天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99CE9CBA449EBDD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310118007:0":{"text":"今夜は冷える。向こうの者たちにもスープを持って行こう……","source_cn":"今晚很冷，我应该给那几位旅人也送些炖汤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9948AFC33BFAC50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310118008:0":{"text":"い、今のは！？","source_cn":"什么声音？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3FB91CF4D14AA97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1310118009:0":{"text":"誰かの叫び声！？向こうの小屋からです！","source_cn":"有人在尖叫！好像是从那个小屋传来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD385B00EF340F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1310118010:0":{"text":"何かあったのかもしれない。まさか小屋の外に出たのか……？","source_cn":"糟糕！那几位旅人恐怕出事了，他们一定有人离开屋子了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7D89CAC9D29F01C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1310118011:0":{"text":"見に行ってくる。","source_cn":"我必须得去看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63DD045871C3324","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1310118012:0":{"text":"私たちも行きます！","source_cn":"我们和你一起去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B7DF0F4E32F3211","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1310118013:0":{"text":"だめだ！君たちはここにいるんだ。決して外に出るんじゃないぞ。","source_cn":"不行！你们呆在这里，随便做什么都可以，但绝不要出门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE40146140B187C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1310118014:0":{"text":"ロンロンたちはすごく強いんですよ！「生きた屍」なんて怖くありません。","source_cn":"我的主人很强的，我们也很厉害，不怕那些“活死人”。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE75EB953E0D03AB6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ロンロンたちはすごく強いんですよ！「生きた屍」なんて怖くありません。","female":"ロンロンたちはすごく強いんですよ！「生きた屍」なんて怖くありません。","variant_male_record_index":"144451","variant_female_record_index":"144452","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1310118015:0":{"text":"そう言って、本当に生き残った者は片手で数えるほどしかいない……","source_cn":"这话我听过太多次了，但说过这句话以后还能活下来的是少数。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62E9AE3421CDF9D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1310118016:0":{"text":"それからもう一つ――","source_cn":"还有一件事，记住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AA1AA620379D7CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1310118017:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">「炎は赤い」</style>、それ以外はすべて疑ってかかれ。忘れるなよ。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>“火是红色的”</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B198AA2DD7A86A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1310118018:1":{"text":"こうしている暇はない。ここで私が戻るのを待っているんだぞ！","source_cn":"不能再耽误时间了，你们在这里等我回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6941BDF79CAF3FCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1310118019:0":{"text":"ま、待ってください！さっきのは一体どういう意味なんですか！？","source_cn":"等等，法拉莫尔先生！你说的话是什么意思——？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF99F420965C93E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1310118020:0":{"text":"行っちゃった……","source_cn":"他离开了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0D70C536FEDC23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1310118021:0":{"text":"風の音も強くなってきましたし、ひとまずここで待ちましょう。","source_cn